These grammars are copied unchanged from Visual Studio Code 1.105.1
(https://github.com/microsoft/vscode, extensions/{html,css,javascript,json}/syntaxes)
so the grammar tests tokenize embedded HTML, CSS, JavaScript and JSON the way the
editor does. Each file names its upstream source in its "version" field.

